ent-FlareActivated = emergency flare
    .desc = A flare that produces a very bright light for a short while. Point the flame away from yourself.
ent-BaseSignalFlare = signal flare
    .desc = A flare that produces a very bright light and an IFF signal for a short while, used for communications in high-intensity situations.
ent-BaseSignalFlareActivated = signal flare
    .desc = A flare that produces a very bright light and an IFF signal for a short while, used for communications in high-intensity situations.
ent-SignalFlareGreenActivated = signal flare (friendly)
    .desc = A flare that produces a very bright light and an IFF signal for a short while. Indicates friendly intent.
ent-SignalFlareGreen = signal flare (friendly)
    .desc = A flare that produces a very bright light and an IFF signal for a short while. Indicates friendly intent.
ent-SignalFlareWhiteActivated = signal flare (neutral/surrender)
    .desc = A flare that produces a very bright light and an IFF signal for a short while. Indicates neutral intent, or, in combat, surrender.
ent-SignalFlareWhite = signal flare (neutral/surrender)
    .desc = A flare that produces a very bright light and an IFF signal for a short while. Indicates neutral intent, or, in combat, surrender.
ent-SignalFlareRedActivated = signal flare (hostile)
    .desc = A flare that produces a very bright light and an IFF signal for a short while. Indicates hostile intent.
ent-SignalFlareRed = signal flare (hostile)
    .desc = A flare that produces a very bright light and an IFF signal for a short while. Indicates hostile intent.
ent-SignalFlareGoldActivated = signal flare (other)
    .desc = A flare that produces a very bright light and an IFF signal for a short while. Indicates a miscellaneous signal.
ent-SignalFlareGold = signal flare (other)
    .desc = A flare that produces a very bright light and an IFF signal for a short while. Indicates a miscellaneous signal.
ent-BoxDispenserFlareGreen = signal flare (friendly) dispenser
    .desc = Dispenses signal flares, used for indicating friendly intent.
ent-BoxDispenserFlareRed = signal flare (hostile) dispenser
    .desc = Dispenses signal flares, used for indicating hostile intent.
ent-BoxDispenserFlareWhite = signal flare (neutral/surrender) dispenser
    .desc = Dispenses signal flares, used for indicating neutral intent or, in combat, surrender.
ent-BoxDispenserFlareGold = signal flare (other) dispenser
    .desc = Dispenses signal flares, used for indicating a miscellaneous signal.
